/target/
/crates/lorica-ebpf/target/
/bench/latency-probe/target/
/bench/store-probe/target/
/bench/progs/*.o
/bench/data/
/.idea/

# Design and conduct documents live outside this repository, in the agent tree. The
# frontier is the inventory §1.1, and it is guarded here because a `git add -A` swept a
# design spec in once already: the product repository holds code and what a third party
# needs to use it or reproduce a figure, and nothing else.
/docs/*
# Two exceptions, and they are user documentation rather than design: what a third
# party needs before they install this and what it will not do for them. Named one by
# one so the guard above still catches everything else.
!/docs/limits.md
!/docs/install.md
!/docs/usage.md
!/docs/architecture.md
